<title>USA: ABR Information Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>ABR Information Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PALM HARBOR, Fla. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited)	Three months ended</p>
<p>					   Oct. 31</p>
<p>				     1995(a)	     1996</p>
<p> Revenue			$5,614,304     $10,389,193</p>
<p> Net income			783,436	 2,611,363</p>
<p> Net income per share		.08		 .19</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	10,159,740	14,009,537</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is ABR Information Services Inc.</p>
<p>(a) Restated for the three-for-two stock split completed on Feb. 19, 1996 and an acquisition by a pooling of interest.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
